# The guide's menu for a documentation site built with MkDocs and awesome-pages, which reads
# `.pages`: the same list, chapter for chapter, as .nav.yml (what Zensical reads). The chapters of
# README.md, in its order and under its three parts; a chapter takes its title in the menu from its
# own first heading, so renaming it in the file renames it here too. README.md is the guide's table
# of contents for the PDF and is not published, and the pages not listed here stay out of the
# navigation.
nav:
    - Overview: index.md
    - Getting started:
        - requirements.md
        - installation.md
        - activation-and-licensing.md
        - coming-from-studio.md
    - Learning:
        - workspaces.md
        - first-report.md
        - concepts.md
        - tutorial-totals.md
        - tutorial-parameters.md
        - tutorial-chart-table.md
        - tutorial-subreport.md
        - tutorial-ai.md
    - Reference:
        - data-adapters.md
        - sample-database.md
        - workspace-settings.md
        - jasperreports-server.md
        - ai-assistant.md
        - styles.md
        - fonts-and-pdf.md
        - custom-visualization-components.md
        - troubleshooting.md